1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Good morning from the harbour.

2
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:16,880
The sea is calm
and the sky is clear.

3
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,960
The first ferry left
at seven o'clock.

4
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:23,440
{\an8}<i>(gulls calling)</i>

5
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:27,320
Wind from the north-west,
about ten knots.

6
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,400
<font color="#ffff00">Fog may form</font>
<font color="#ffff00">near the lighthouse.</font>

7
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,880
Fishing boats return
before noon.

8
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:37,760
{\an8}<i>(engine starts)</i>

9
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:40,840
The fish market opens
at half past eight.

10
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:44,320
Water temperature
is twelve degrees.

11
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:48,200
Tide tables are <b>on the <u>board</u></b>

12
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:51,280
High tide at 14:20.

13
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:54,760
Low tide at 20:35.

14
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:58,640
Rain is likely
after six this evening.

15
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:01,720
{\an8}<i>(bell rings)</i>

16
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:05,200
The harbour office
closes at five.

17
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:09,080
<font color="#ffff00">Small boats should</font>
<font color="#ffff00">stay inside the wall.</font>

18
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:12,160
Tomorrow starts
cold and bright.

19
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:15,640
That is all
from the harbour.

20
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:19,520
{\an8}<i>(music)</i>
